  "thag1.108:0.4": "1. 11. 8. ",
  "thag1.108:1.1": "sa vīsaṃvassasatiko ",
  "thag1.108:1.2": "pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ, ",
  "thag1.108:1.3": "tisso vijjā anuppattā ",
  "thag1.108:1.4": "kataṃ buddhassa sāsana’nti. ",
  "thag1.108:1.5": "itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā dhammasavapitutthero gāthaṃ abhāsitthā’ti. dhammasavapituttheragāthā. "
}
